{"id": 2755, "ru": "<+wd> скорми мирк.ехе в дрвеба\n<[Sheridan]> mirc.exe contains a potentially dangerous software Program.mIRC.616\n<[Sheridan]> тыпроэто?\n<+wd> мне интересно - а почему оно так на ntoskrnl.exe не ругаецо?\n<[Sheridan]> Как не ругается?\n<[Sheridan]> ntoskrnl.exe contains a potentially dangerous software MS.kernel.nt", "en": "<+wd> feed mirc.exe into drweb\n<[Sheridan]> mirc.exe contains a potentially dangerous software Program.mIRC.616\n<[Sheridan]> you mean this?\n<+wd> I'm just curious - why doesn't it bitch about ntoskrnl.exe like that?\n<[Sheridan]> What do you mean it doesn't bitch?\n<[Sheridan]> ntoskrnl.exe contains a potentially dangerous software MS.kernel.nt"}
