{"id": 3884, "ru": ":: Омега is now known as Омега|душ\n @ thresh: Вот интересно\n @ thresh: Почему люди пишут там\n @ thresh: Ник|Туалет\n @ thresh: Ник|ванная\n @ thresh: Ник|душ\n @ thresh: но никогда не пишут Ник|IRC\n @ thresh: ?!\n :: Svetilniks is now known as Svetilniks|IRC\n :: Снеговик is now known as Снеговик|IRC\n @ thresh: ...", "en": ":: Омега is now known as Омега|shower\n @ thresh: Interesting\n @ thresh: Why do people write there\n @ thresh: Nick|Toilet\n @ thresh: Nick|bathroom\n @ thresh: Nick|shower\n @ thresh: but never write Nick|IRC\n @ thresh: ?!\n :: Svetilniks is now known as Svetilniks|IRC\n :: Снеговик is now known as Снеговик|IRC\n @ thresh: ..."}
