{"id": 4187, "ru": "<tSteve> !seen OVK\n<TEHb> tSteve, OVK (~OVK@83.149.51.1) was last seen quitting from #*** 2 hours 30 seconds ago (25.11. 22:44) stating \"\"Мяу-мяу, я кис-кис, но игрушки я не грыз, с одеялом не играл, и газету я не рвал, и не я разлил потом эту чашку с молоком. Мяу-мяу, нет, не я, и ругаетесь вы зря!\"\" after spending 31 minutes 25 seconds there.\n<Paul[home]> Спида нашел для Орлана чудный квит\n<Paul[home]> Хрю-хрю-хрю, я подлый свин,\n<Paul[home]> но бухал я не один,\n<Paul[home]> не нажрался я в говно \n<Paul[home]> и в салате спал давно, \n<Paul[home]> и не я блевал потом \n<Paul[home]> в подворотне на Морском.", "en": "<tSteve> !seen OVK\n<TEHb> tSteve, OVK (~OVK@83.149.51.1) was last seen quitting from #*** 2 hours 30 seconds ago (25.11. 22:44) stating \"\"Meow-meow, I'm a kitty, but I didn't chew the toys, didn't play with the blanket, and didn't tear the newspaper, and it wasn't me who spilled that cup of milk afterwards. Meow-meow, no, not me, and you're scolding me for nothing!\"\" after spending 31 minutes 25 seconds there.\n<Paul[home]> Found a wonderful quit for Orlan from Spida\n<Paul[home]> Oink-oink-oink, I'm a sneaky swine,\n<Paul[home]> but I wasn't drinking alone,\n<Paul[home]> didn't get shitfaced,\n<Paul[home]> and long ago slept in the salad,\n<Paul[home]> and it wasn't me who puked afterwards\n<Paul[home]> in the alley on Morskoy."}
