{"id": 9965, "ru": "<wackum> открой проводник, и нажми * на нампаде\n<Soont> я нажал * прикольно....\n<wackum> а теперь нажмите все alt+z\n<wackum> в ирке\n* Soont (Soont@ppp-129.pool-002.spbnit.ru) has left #supertrubka.ru\n* Soont (Soont@ppp-129.pool-002.spbnit.ru) has joined #supertrubka.ru\n* ChanServ sets mode: +v Soont\n<wackum> а если хочешь отомстить напиши /quit wackum и я вылечу с ирки\n<Soont> А теперь нажимаем кнопку выключения компьютера\n<Soont> да ну\n* Soont (Soont@ppp-129.pool-002.spbnit.ru) Quit (\"rit88\")\n* Soont (Soont@ppp-129.pool-002.spbnit.ru) has joined #supertrubka.ru\n* ChanServ sets mode: +v Soont\n<Soont> Ты блин фигов хакер,какое у тебя там мыло?....щас я веселиться буду....", "en": "<wackum> open explorer, and press * on the numpad\n<Soont> I pressed * cool....\n<wackum> and now everyone press alt+z\n<wackum> in irc\n* Soont (Soont@ppp-129.pool-002.spbnit.ru) has left #supertrubka.ru\n* Soont (Soont@ppp-129.pool-002.spbnit.ru) has joined #supertrubka.ru\n* ChanServ sets mode: +v Soont\n<wackum> and if you want revenge write /quit wackum and I'll fly out of irc\n<Soont> And now we press the computer power button\n<Soont> yeah right\n* Soont (Soont@ppp-129.pool-002.spbnit.ru) Quit (\"rit88\")\n* Soont (Soont@ppp-129.pool-002.spbnit.ru) has joined #supertrubka.ru\n* ChanServ sets mode: +v Soont\n<Soont> You damn fake hacker, what's your email there?....now I'll have fun...."}
